# Rowdy Snowballers {2}{U}, 2/2: "When this creature enters, tap target creature an opponent controls and put a stun counter on it" (CR 122.1d, 701.26a). Cast on turn 3,
# its trigger refuses Bot1's own Ornithopter and Bot2's Mox Jet (an artifact that is no creature), and takes Bot2's Memnite rather than its Phyrexian Walker: tapped, one stun counter.
# In Bot2's untap step on turn 4 the counter is removed instead of the Memnite untapping, so it stays tapped; the Ornithopter is untouched.

